- The journey takes approximately 6 minutes
- Hokkaido Shrine is a highly-rated attraction (9.1/10) perfect for New Year's Day

**Recommendation:** Since this is a team event, I'd suggest either the **Large People Carrier** (for up to 8 people) or the **Minibus** (also for 8 people) depending on your group size and budget. The Hokkaido Shrine is an excellent choice for welcoming the New Year with your colleagues!

